==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==Battleground==
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this stage has a deploy limit of 15, it is advisable to level up [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] so that it is easier facing Angelic Beast Rajakong. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can help with their Behemoth Slayer ability.

